      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone I'm wondering if there's any useful/helpful list of apps, companies, or resources in general that avoid AI (they don't have to be vocally or openly "anti", but at least explicitly avoid it) that you know of?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I'm not looking to start a discussion on what's good/bad or (un)worthy about AI, or who's for/against, just links and/or communities promoting this sentiment/position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For example, &lt;a href="https://www.rebeltechalliance.org" rel="ugc"&gt;https://www.rebeltechalliance.org&lt;/a&gt; would be one of those resources.&lt;/p&gt;
